# Local data — ignore the bulk corpora but TRACK the index/README
# files inside `data/` so the data layout is in git even when the
# pulled jsonl/images stay local-only. Git can't re-include a file
# inside an ignored directory, so we list each subfolder explicitly.
.local/
data/medqa-bench/*
data/isic-sample/*
data/drugbank-sample/*
data/pubmed-cache/*
data/image-bench/*
data/hf-bench/*
data/kaggle/*
data/kg/*
# But DO track these markers + READMEs everywhere
!data/medqa-bench/.gitkeep
!data/isic-sample/.gitkeep
!data/drugbank-sample/.gitkeep
!data/pubmed-cache/.gitkeep
!data/image-bench/.gitkeep
!data/hf-bench/.gitkeep
!data/kaggle/.gitkeep
!data/**/README.md
!data/**/manifest.json
!data/**/.manifest.json
# Curated harness data (committed eval datasets)
!scripts/data/
!scripts/data/**
*.sqlite
*.db

# Project-private rules live outside the repo. Never commit.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md.bak
working-rules-portable/

# local screenshot / Chrome profile cache (not project-related)
.local-screens/

# Vite dep-pre-bundle cache (relocated to OS tmpdir in vite.config.ts)
**/.vite-cache/
**/.vite/

# Internal architect/AI coaching docs — kept on disk, not in public history
docs/reports/architect-*.md
docs/reports/project-defense-report-*.md
docs/reports/deployment-readiness-*.md
docs/3-day-plan.md
docs/3-day-demo-plan.md
docs/MASTER-PLAN-*.md
docs/status/day-*-summary.md
docs/status/full-system-test-*.md
docs/status/system-audit-*.md
docs/status/mobile-audit-*.md
docs/project-report.md
docs/project-submission-report.md
docs/EVE-REPORT-*.md
docs/PLAN-v*.md
docs/UI-AUDIT-v*.md
docs/MANUAL-TEST-PLAN.md
docs/accuracy-personal-use-cases.md
